{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>A man of the field.</b> Knowledgeable in the cultivation of the ground." "<b>A dweller of tents.</b> Two kinds of tents: one, the tent of shepherds; the second, the tent of which it says בַּל יִצְעָן (Isaiah 33:20) — in which he meditated to know his Creator and was sanctified in His glory."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:40.715971814Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}